30
00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.530
You've had a chance to step back

31
00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.730
and take a look at all that

32
00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:22.010
and see how the year is going so far.

33
00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:26.010
Now it's time to evaluate.

34
00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:28.510
Now this might not be something you're used to doing,

35
00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:30.610
but I highly encourage it.

36
00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.810
I think it's really, really helpful in moving forward.

37
