So we're gonna call this your midterm.

38
00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.090
So get ready, because you have a quiz and a test coming up

39
00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.610
and you're gonna need, no, I'm just kidding.

40
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.290
You have two, I just have two suggestions.

