00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:47.290
First thing is something that I've been doing

43
00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.610
for years with students that I think is awesome

44
00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:51.810
is have them do something.

45
00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.490
I mean, instead of just having them listen

46
00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.650
and maybe engage in discussion,

47
