65
00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.850
and then we'll kind of compel other students

66
00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:40.610
and it's changing things up and it's kind of fun

67
00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:41.450
and it's something different

68
00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.010
